# D3-LI-001: Two natural pigments can share a colour without sharing a spectrum
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
new
new
add v1 ethanol 30mL
add v1 chlorophyll 0.0000005mol
add v2 water 30mL
add v2 betanin 0.0000005mol
add v3 ethanol 30mL
add v4 water 30mL
look v1
look v2
measure v1 uvvis
measure v2 uvvis
measure v3 uvvis
measure v4 uvvis
inspect
